  "title": "NCR Atleos extends long-standing relationship with Shell UK Oil Products to operate ATMs across national forecourt network",
  "summary": "NCR Atleos Corporation (NYSE: NATL) (“Atleos”), a leader in expanding self-service financial access for financial institutions, retailers and consumers, today announced an extension of its long-standing relationship with Shell UK Oil Products Limited, to operate ATMs across Shell’s forecourt network in the United Kingdom.",
